rce-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr211"></a><strong>Кўчмас мулк ижара шартномасини бекор қилиш ҳақидаги келишувни ҳисобга қўйилганлиги ҳақида </strong><br><strong>Б И Л Д И Р И Ш Н О М А</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="10" style="vertical-align: top;  width: 100%;  text-align: left"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/7371/bssPhr212/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="212" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr212"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/7371/dfasbwppwl/"></a>Ижара шартномасининг реестр бўйича тартиб рақами: ______________________________________</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="7" style="vertical-align: top;  width: 80.7%;  text-align: left"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/7371/bssPhr213/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="213" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr213"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/7371/dfasb3hwls/"></a>Ижарага берувчининг Ф.И.О.:_________________________________</p></td><td colspan="3" rowspan="7" style="vertical-align: top;  width: 12.4%;  text-align: left"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/7371/bssPhr214/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="214" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr214"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/7371/dfasn16xv3/"></a><img alt="http://lex.uz/ru/files/4439661" style="width:94px height: 94px" class="inimg" src="https://1gb.uz/system/content/image/297/1/-23855015/" width="94" height="94"></p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align: top;  width: 12.9%;  text-align: left"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/7371/dfasogxr95/"></a></p></td><td colspan="6" style="vertical-align: top;  width: 62%;  text-align: left"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/7371/bssPhr215/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="215" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr215"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/7371/dfasfbc7u4/"></a>__________________________________</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="7" style="vertical-align: top;  width: 80.7%;  text-align: left"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/7371/bssPhr216/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="216" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr216"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/7371/dfasxr6sgy/"></a>Ижарага берувчинингдоимий рўйхатдан ўтган жойи: ______________ _________________________________________________________</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="7" style="vertical-align: top;  width: 80.7%;  text-align: left"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/7371/bssPhr217/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="217" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr217"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/7371/dfas2yprg2/"></a>Ижарага берувчининг идентификация рақами (СТИР):______________</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="7" style="vertical-align: top;  width: 80.7%;  text-align: left"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/7371/bssPhr218/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="218" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr218"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/7371/dfas7ylvpf/"></a>Ижарага олувчининг Ф.И.О.: __________________________________</p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align: top;  width: 12.9%;  text-align: left"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/7371/dfas0hgehi/"></a></p></td><td colspan="6" style="vertical-align: top;  width: 62%;  text-align: left"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/7371/bssPhr219/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="219" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr219"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/7371/dfasl35v8a/"></a>__________________________________</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="7" style="vertical-align: top;  width: 80.7%;  text-align: left"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/7371/bssPhr220/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="220" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr220"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/7371/dfaskgczvl/"></a>Ижара шартномаси ҳисобга олинган сана: 20__ йил &#171;____&#187; _________<br>Ижара шартномаси бекор қилинганлиги ҳақидаги келишувни ҳисобга олинган сана: 20__ йил &#171;___&#187; __________</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="10" style="vertical-align: top;  width: 100%;  text-align: left"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/7371/bssPhr221/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="221" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr221"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/7371/dfasu5yqhh/"></a>Ижарага берилган кўчмас мулкнинг жойлашган манзили:____________________________________<br>__________________________________________________________________________________<br>__________________________________________________________________________________</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="10" style="vertical-align: top;  width: 100%;  text-align: left"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/7371/bssPhr222/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="222" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr222"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/7371/dfas9dxxdp/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/7371/dfask5p8yn/"></a>Мазкур ҳужжатнинг ҳақиқийлигини текшириш учун QR-кодни* махсус мобил илова орқали текшириб кўришингиз ёки ушбу ҳаволага (кўчмас мулк ижара шартномаси электрон шаклига ҳавола) кириб кўришингиз мумкин.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div></div><div xmlns="" class="footer">© Материал из ЭС "ACTION: Главбух"<br />https://1gb.uz<br />Дата копирования: 29.09.2026</div></body></html>